   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "A 먼저 UPDATE -> B UPDATE -> A 커밋 -> B 커밋 시도\n\nERROR: could not serialize access due to\nread/write dependencies among transactions\nReason code: Canceled on identification as a\npivot, during commit attempt.",
   "originalText": "A 먼저 UPDATE -> B UPDATE -> A 커밋 -> B 커밋 시도\n\nERROR: could not serialize access due to\nread/write dependencies among transactions\nReason code: Canceled on identification as a\npivot, during commit attempt.",
